+4. Changed weekly `nextFocus` generation into a direct trading rule instead of
+   an app/navigation task like opening or reviewing trades.
+5. Added regression coverage that weekly `nextFocus` does not start from
+   `open`, `inspect`, `review`, `journal`, or `write down`.
+6. Regenerated the local weekly review with the synthetic notes; the corrected
